schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-character-the-survivor
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art portrait of a gender-neutral alchemist survivor protagonist
    in a worn leather duster coat with frayed hem and scorched edges. A heavy belt carries
    alchemical tools: glass vials of amber liquid, a brass tongs, a small mortar and pestle,
    and a leather-bound journal. Their face is gaunt and smudged with soot, eyes tired but
    holding fierce determination. Short disheveled hair. An amber lantern hangs from their
    belt, casting a warm sickly glow that pools on the ground. The background is absolute
    darkness with faint geometric transmutation symbols barely visible in deep indigo. Painterly
    style, atmospheric lighting, heavy chiaroscuro. The mood is survival against impossible
    odds — someone who has seen the boundary between worlds tear open and chose to walk through
    it anyway. Concept art quality, detailed texture work on leather and metal, visible
    brushstrokes in shadows.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, clean magic, glowing eyes, superhero pose, clean clothing, smiling, colorful palette, flat shading, low detail"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "2:3"

tags: [character, protagonist, alchemist, portrait, concept-art, dark-fantasy]
